{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24418","headline":"奉和裴令公三月上巳日游太原龙泉忆去岁禊洛见示之作 · 白居易","name":"奉和裴令公三月上巳日游太原龙泉忆去岁禊洛见示之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去岁暮春上巳，共泛洛水中流。\n今岁暮春上巳，独立香山下头。\n风光闲寂寂，旌斾远悠悠。\n丞相府归晋国，太行山碍幷州。\n鹏背负天龟曳尾，云泥不可得同游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24418.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24418","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}